On Android and iOS that's the same change: drop `Branch.getAutoInstance()` and the `initSession` callback, start the Strait client at launch, and subscribe to `onLink`. Deferred links (the link someone tapped before installing) arrive through the same callback with `kind` set to `deferred`.

