```

Then update app verification to your link domain: on Android change the intent filter's `android:host` to `acme.strait.link` and add your SHA-256 fingerprints in Settings; on iPhone change Associated Domains to `applinks:acme.strait.link` and add your Team ID and bundle ID in Settings. See [App Links & Universal Links](https://straitlink.in/docs/app-links/).
